artifact_delta.cold:
- remove a member (after confirmation); the removed member immediately loses
  access to the circle and its members' data, as if they had left;
- see, copy, share and reset the invite link;
- see the list of removed people and allow any of them back;
- rename the circle;

artifact_delta.final:
- remove a member and clear all removals;
- retrieve, share and reset the invite link;
- rename the circle, under the same 1 to 40 character rule as creating it;
